{"id":"n67315-1-10","stage":2,"title":"얼른 · 快地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67315-1-10-1","ko":"벌써 아침 여덟 시야. 얼른 일어나서 나갈 준비해.","zh":"已经早上八点了。快起床，准备出门吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}},{"text":"여덟","meaning":"八","explanation":"여덟：八","readings":[{"term":"여덟","audio":"/audio/042fbd833c9fdd6b8ba3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17284","senseId":"1","lemma":"여덟","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여덟","audio":"/audio/042fbd833c9fdd6b8ba3.mp3"}},{"text":"시야.","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시야","audio":"/audio/c30f56ae00dca78e3875.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"일어나서","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"