":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf1974acf179af42a219.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67315-1-10-2","ko":"십 분만 더 잘게. 너무 졸려.","zh":"再睡十分钟就好啦，我实在太困了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}},{"text":"분만","meaning":"分，分钟","explanation":"분：分，分钟；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70891","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분만","audio":"/audio/826d4078d55fb60896f6.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘게.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘게","audio":"/audio/dccb11eb2c33e1474821.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"졸려.","meaning":"困","explanation":"졸리다：困；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"졸리다","audio":"/audio/2666ddee9bee00d2539f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24623","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졸려","